</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(R99_Alarms,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R01_Inputs" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[This routine contains all input mapping not handled by parameter mapping]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\Supervisor.q_ManualMode)XIC(\SafetyProgram.q_EstopOk)OTE(in_Mode.Auto);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_ManualMode)OTE(in_Mode.Manual);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_CycleStartLatch)[OTE(in_Mode.Starting) ,OTE(in_Mode.Running) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_CycleStopped)ONS(OneShot.15)OTE(in_Mode.Stopped);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\Supervisor.q_CycleStartLatch)XIO(\Supervisor.q_CycleStopped)OTE(in_Mode.Stopping);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MB.PowerUpCP)OTE(in_PowerUpComplete);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\SafetyProgram.q_EstopOk)OTE(in_Safety.EStopNOK);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\SafetyProgram.q_EstopOk)OTE(in_Safety.EStopOK);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_SafetyOK)OTE(in_Safety.OK);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Supervisor.q_FaultReset)OTE(FaultReset);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Copy EDA data in]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPS(r01_FlexFeeder:I1.Input[0],EDA.in,1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R05_RobotInputs" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Copy EDA data in]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPS(r01_FlexFeeder:I2.Input[0],EDA.in,1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Copy handshaking in (outputs from robot)
Required DIO/system/setup config:
IO\UOP out (all):  Rack 89, slot 1, start pt 1
Digital outputs:  1-64:  Rack 89, slot 1, start pt 57
200-231:  Rack 89, slot 1, start pt 25
Group outputs (Rack 89, slot 1, 8 bits each).  Start points:  1: 121, 2: 129, 3: 137, 4:145, 5: 153
In System\Config screen set the following:
Signal to set in AUTO mode: DO[200]
Signal to set in T1 mode:  DO[201]
Signal to set in T2 mode:  DO[202]
Signal to set if E-STOP:  DO[203]
Set if INPUT SIMULATED:  DO[204]
Set if OUTPUT SIMULATED:  DO[205]
Signal if OVERRIDE = 100:  DO[206]
Remote/Local setup:  Remote
UOP auto assignment:  None
No motion PR operate mode:  TRUE (allows BG logic to read/write elements of PR)
Confirmation for auto:  only needed for SCARA using TP mode select (set to DI[0] otherwise)
Chain failure output:  DO[219] (note: only available on v9.40 and above)

Other system\config items are set related to outputs, see outputs routine

On Setup\Col Guard screen, set:
Collision Guard Error:  DO[208]
Col. Guard enabled:  DO[207]

On Setup\Ref Positions, set DO 209-218 as the outputs for ref positions 1-10 (unused ref positions don't need to be configured)

On IO\Cell Interface, set:
Heartbeat:  DO[220]

BG Logic program should set DO[221]=DO[220] and DO[222]=$SSR.SINGLESTEP

]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPS(r01_FlexFeeder:I1.Input[0],RIN,1);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RIN.PartLoadComplete)ONS(OneShot.2)[OTL(\S01_Load.i_RobotPartPlaced) OTL(HandshakeAck) ,[XIC(in_Mode.Stopping) ,XIC(Status.State[7]) ,XIC(Man_SafeHome.Running) ] XIC(MB.AlwaysOff) OTL(q_CleanoutReq) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(RIN.DO8)OTE(\S01_Load.i_RobotPlacingPart);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(c_DG_Debug.4)OTU(\S01_Load.i_RobotPartPlaced);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RIN.DO22)OTE(q_FlexFeedConvReady);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RIN.GripperClosed)OTE(q_RobotGripperClosed);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MB.AlwaysOff)AOI_Debounce(AOI_FlexFeedConvReady,q_FlexFeedConvReady,1000,1000);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(q_FlexFeedConvReady)TON(ConveyorOnDelay,?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(q_FlexFeedConvReady)TON(ConveyorOffDelay,?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(ConveyorOnDelay.DN) ,XIC(q_FlexFeedConvReadyOn) ]XIO(ConveyorOffDelay.DN)OTE(q_FlexFeedConvReadyOn);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R10_ClearSignals" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Routine used to generate signals when robot is clear of various parts of machine
Use EDA curpos]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RIN.NestOpenerRet)GT(EDA.in.PR111_G1.Y,-70)OTE(IsClearOfDial);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Signals to Indexer Dial for Debug]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(RIN.NestOpenerRet) OTE(q_NestIsClosed) ,GT(EDA.in.PR111_G1.Y,-70) OTE(q_RobotIsClear) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R50_StateLogic" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[*****MISCELLANEOUS LOGIC*****]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[6])XIO(RIN.InputSimulated)XIO(RIN.OutputSimulated)XIO(RIN.SingleStep)OTE(ReadyOK);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 0
Estop/Door open]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[0])XIC(in_Safety.OK)MOVE(5,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 5
Idle, Not Ready]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[5])XIC(ReadyOK)XIO(in_Mode.Manual)MOVE(6,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 6
Idle, Ready]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[6])[OTE(q_StartOk) ,XIC(in_Mode.Running) [XIC(RIN.AtRefPosn1) [EQ(\S01_Load.q_RobotActiveTool,ActiveRecipe.RobotEndEffector) MOVE(9,Control.StateReg) ,NE(\S01_Load.q_RobotActiveTool,ActiveRecipe.RobotEndEffector) MOVE(15,Control.StateReg) ] ,XIO(RIN.AtRefPosn1) MOVE(7,Control.StateReg) ] ,XIO(ReadyOK) MOVE(5,Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 7
Auto mode safehome]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[7])Run_Robot_Seq(AutoSH,1,60,Running_Seq,SequenceReq,RIN)[XIC(AutoSH.Complete) ,XIC(AutoSH.Failed) ]MOVE(5,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 9
Start PKMAIN program for auto mode]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[9])Run_Robot_Seq(PKMain_Auto,10,0,Running_Seq,SequenceReq,RIN)XIC(PKMain_Auto.Running)MOVE(10,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 10

PKMain running]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[10])[XIC(in_Mode.Running) XIO(PKMain_Auto.Running) AFI() MOVE(9,Control.StateReg) ,XIO(in_Mode.Running) XIO(PKMain_Auto.Running) [XIO(RIN.AtRefPosn1) MOVE(7,Control.StateReg) ,XIC(RIN.AtRefPosn1) MOVE(5,Control.StateReg) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 9
Start PKMAIN program for auto mode]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[15])Run_Robot_Seq(PKMain_Auto,32,0,Running_Seq,SequenceReq,RIN)XIC(\S01_Load.q_ToolChangeComplete)MOVE(6,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 100
Start reset sequence]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[100])NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 127
Faulted]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Status.State[127])[XIO(FaultActive) MOVE(0,Control.StateReg) ,XIC(Status.StateChangeOccurred_OS) OTL(AbortAll) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[****IMMEDIATE TRANSITIONS****]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(FaultActive) ,XIC(Status.State[15]) XIC(\S01_Load.q_AlarmActive) ,XIC(RPM_FaultActive) ][XIO(Status.State[127]) XIO(Status.State[0]) MOVE(Control.StateReg,FaultedState) ,MOVE(127,Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(in_Safety.OK) ,XIC(in_Mode.Aborting) ,XIC(S:FS) ]MOVE(0,Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[State_Engine_128Max(AOI_SM,Control,Status,StateHistory);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R55_RobotProgramManager" Type="RLL">
<Description>
<![CDATA[Routine that manages handshaking with the AAMAIN program in the robot]]>
</Description>
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[This is the state machine that handles sequences via the Run_Robot_Sequence AOI
It also handles fault reset and program start handshaking

This is done as a separate state machine within robot program instead of as its own program because it shares many signals with the customizable logic for other aspects of the robot and separating it would result in scan delays]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 0
EStop]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[0])XIC(in_Safety.EStopOK)MOVE(1,RPM_Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 1
Check robot status (faulted/paused/running/aborted)
If robot is in manual mode or TP enabled, stays here until robot is switched into auto]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[1])XIO(c_DG_Debug.5)XIC(RIN.AutoMode)XIO(RIN.TPEnabled)XIO(RIN.SingleStep)[XIC(RIN.Faulted) MOVE(2,RPM_Control.StateReg) ,XIO(RIN.Faulted) [XIC(RIN.Running) XIC(RIN.WaitingForCMD) MOVE(5,RPM_Control.StateReg) ,[XIC(RIN.Paused) ,XIC(RIN.Running) XIO(RIN.WaitingForCMD) ] MOVE(4,RPM_Control.StateReg) ,XIO(RIN.Running) XIO(RIN.Paused) MOVE(3,RPM_Control.StateReg) ] ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 2
Robot Fault Reset]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[2])MOVE(500,RPM_Control.TransitionTime)XIC(RPM_Status.TransitionTimerDone)[XIO(TMR_RobotFaultReset.DN) OTE(ROUT.FaultReset) ,TON(TMR_RobotFaultReset,?,?) ,XIO(RIN.Faulted) MOVE(1,RPM_Control.StateReg) ,XIC(TMR_RobotFaultReset.DN) XIC(RIN.Faulted) MOVE(1,RPM_Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 3
Start robot program]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[3])XIC(RIN.CMDENBL)MOVE(500,RPM_Control.TransitionTime)MOVE(5000,RPM_Control.FaultTime)XIC(RPM_Status.TransitionTimerDone)[TON(TMR_RobotProdStart,?,?) XIO(TMR_RobotProdStart.DN) OTE(ROUT.ProductionStart) ,XIC(RIN.Running) MOVE(5,RPM_Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 4
Resume or Abort Robot Program]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[4])MOVE(500,RPM_Control.TransitionTime)MOVE(1000,RPM_Control.FaultTime)[XIC(ResumeOK) XIC(RPM_Status.TransitionTimerDone) [TON(TMR_ResumeProgram,?,?) XIO(TMR_ResumeProgram.DN) OTE(ROUT.Start) ,XIC(RIN.Running) [XIC(RIN.WaitingForCMD) MOVE(5,RPM_Control.StateReg) ,XIC(RIN.CMDRunning) MOVE(11,RPM_Control.StateReg) ] OTU(ResumeOK) ,XIC(RPM_Status.TimeoutFlt) MOVE(1,RPM_Control.StateReg) OTU(ResumeOK) ] ,XIO(ResumeOK) OTE(ROUT.CycleStop) XIC(RPM_Status.TransitionTimerDone) MOVE(0,ROUT.Command) MOVE(1,RPM_Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 5
Idle, not ready (Robot program startup handshaking not done)]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[5])[XIC(RIN.ReqPLCResetCMD) MOVE(0,ROUT.Command) ,XIO(RIN.ReqPLCResetCMD) XIC(RIN.WaitingForCMD) MOVE(6,RPM_Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 6
Idle, Ready]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[6])[XIO(RIN.WaitingForCMD) XIC(RIN.Running) MOVE(5,RPM_Control.StateReg) ,NE(SequenceReq,0) MOVE(10,RPM_Control.StateReg) ,MOVE(0,Running_Seq) ,[XIC(AOI_FlexFeed_Recipe.PC) XIC(ResumeOK) ,XIO(in_Mode.Running) NE(ActiveRecipe.RobotEndEffector,RobotEndEffectorPre) ] MOVE(4,RPM_Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 10
Send command to robot]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[10])[ONS(ONS_RPM.10) MOVE(SequenceReq,ROUT.Command) ,[XIC(RIN.CMDRunning) ,XIC(RIN.CMDComplete) ] EQ(RIN.CMDEcho,ROUT.Command) MOVE(ROUT.Command,Running_Seq) MOVE(0,SequenceReq) MOVE(11,RPM_Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 11
Wait for command to finish]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[11])[XIC(RIN.CMDComplete) ,XIC(RIN.CMDFailed) ][MOVE(12,RPM_Control.StateReg) ,COP(SeqHistory[1],SeqHistory[0],9) MOVE(Running_Seq,SeqHistory[9]) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 12
Post-sequence handshaking]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[12])[XIC(RIN.ReqPLCResetCMD) MOVE(0,ROUT.Command) ,XIC(RIN.WaitingForCMD) MOVE(6,RPM_Control.StateReg) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[State 127
Faulted]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_Status.State[127])OTU(ResumeOK)XIO(RPM_FaultActive)MOVE(1,RPM_Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[*****IMMEDIATE TRANSITIONS*****]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RPM_FaultActive)MOVE(127,RPM_Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(AbortAll)[XIC(RIN.Running) ,XIC(RIN.Paused) ]OTU(ResumeOK)XIO(RPM_FaultActive)OTU(AbortAll)MOVE(4,RPM_Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(AbortAll)OTU(ResumeOK)OTU(AbortAll)MOVE(4,RPM_Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(in_Safety.OK) ,XIC(in_Mode.Aborting) ,XIC(S:FS) ]OTU(ResumeOK)MOVE(0,RPM_Control.StateReg);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[State_Engine_128Max(AOI_SM_RPM,RPM_Control,RPM_Status,StateHistory);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R70_ManualControl" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Toggles for special run modes]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(in_Mode.Manual)XIC(HMI_PlacePartsInChute)OTE(ROUT.DropPartsChute);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Disable/grey out all manual buttons when a sequence is running or the safety circuit is open]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[NE(Running_Seq,0) ,XIO(in_Safety.OK) ]OTE(DisableManSeq);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(\IndexerDial.q_IndexerInPosition)OTE(HMI_OpenNest.InterlockActive)OTE(HMI_PlaceDial.InterlockActive);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(RIN.ConvMoving)OTU(ROUT.ReqFeederOn)OTE(HMI_RunFeeder.InterlockActive);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[HMI_OutTog(HMI_RunConv,1,ROUT.ReqConvOn,c_DummyBOOL,RIN.ConvMoving,0,in_Mode.Manual,RIN.Faulted,SecurityLevel,0,0)HMI_OutTog(HMI_ReturnConv,1,RunReturnConv,c_DummyBOOL,OUT_RunReturnConv,0,in_Mode.Manual,in_Safety.EStopNOK,SecurityLevel,0,0)HMI_OutTog(HMI_RunFeeder,1,ROUT.ReqFeederOn,c_DummyBOOL,1,0,in_Mode.Manual,in_Safety.EStopNOK,SecurityLevel,0,0)HMI_OutTog(HMI_OpenGripper,1,GripOpenReq,c_DummyBOOL,1,0,in_Mode.Manual,in_Safety.EStopNOK,SecurityLevel,0,0)HMI_OutTog(HMI_OpenNest,1,NestOpenReq,c_DummyBOOL,1,0,in_Mode.Manual,in_Safety.EStopNOK,SecurityLevel,0,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MB.AlwaysOff)XIC(in_Mode.Manual)[ONS(OneShot.7) [XIO(RIN.GripperOpen) OTU(GripOpenReq) ,XIC(RIN.GripperOpen) OTL(GripOpenReq) ,XIO(RIN.NestOpenerExtValveOn) OTU(NestOpenReq) ,XIC(RIN.NestOpenerExtValveOn) OTL(NestOpenReq) ] ,XIC(GripOpenReq) ONS(OneShot.3) OTL(ROUT.ReqGripOpen) ,XIO(GripOpenReq) ONS(OneShot.4) OTL(ROUT.ReqGripClose) ,XIC(NestOpenReq) ONS(OneShot.5) OTL(ROUT.ReqNestOpenerExt) ,XIO(NestOpenReq) ONS(OneShot.6) OTL(ROUT.ReqNestOpenerRet) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(in_Mode.Running) ,XIC(in_Mode.Stopping) ]OTU(ROUT.ReqConvOn)OTU(ROUT.ReqFeederOn);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[HMI_OutMom(HMI_Abort,0,0,0,0,1,0,SecurityLevel,0,1)XIC(HMI_Abort.Out)OTL(AbortAll);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Manual sequences]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Seq 1: safe home]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[HMI_OutMom(HMI_SafeHome,1,1000,1,Man_SafeHome.Running,in_Mode.Manual,DisableManSeq,SecurityLevel,0,1) ,XIC(HMI_SafeHome.Out) Run_Robot_Seq(Man_SafeHome,1,300,Running_Seq,SequenceReq,RIN) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Seq 10 (PK main):  single part pick/run pkmain]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MB.AlwaysOff)[HMI_OutMom(HMI_SinglePartPick,1,1000,1,Man_RunPKMain.Running,in_Mode.Manual,DisableManSeq,SecurityLevel,0,1) HMI_OutMom(HMI_RunCycle,1,1000,1,Man_RunPKMain.Running,in_Mode.Manual,DisableManSeq,SecurityLevel,0,1) ,[XIC(HMI_SinglePartPick.Out) OTL(ROUT.PickSinglePart) ,XIC(HMI_RunCycle.Out) ] Run_Robot_Seq(Man_RunPKMain,10,0,Running_Seq,SequenceReq,RIN) ,XIC(ROUT.PickSinglePart) [XIC(Man_RunPKMain.Complete) ,XIC(in_Mode.Auto) ] OTU(ROUT.PickSinglePart) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Seq 30:  place dial]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[HMI_OutMom(HMI_PlaceDial,1,1000,1,Man_PlaceDial.Running,in_Mode.Manual,DisableManSeq,SecurityLevel,0,1) ,XIC(HMI_PlaceDial.Out) Run_Robot_Seq(Man_PlaceDial,30,0,Running_Seq,SequenceReq,RIN) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Seq 35:  Go to/from maintenance position
program will check for robot to be at home or at maint position]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIO(RIN.AtRefPosn1) XIO(RIN.AtRefPosn2) OTE(HMI_MaintPos.InterlockActive) ,HMI_OutMom(HMI_MaintPos,1,1000,1,Man_MaintPos.Running,in_Mode.Manual,DisableManSeq,SecurityLevel,0,1) ,[XIC(HMI_MaintPos.Out) ,XIO(in_Mode.Running) XIO(in_Mode.Stopping) XIO(HMI_MaintPos.InterlockActive) XIO(RIN.AtRefPosn2) XIC(HMI_b_Changeover) ] Run_Robot_Seq(Man_MaintPos,35,0,Running_Seq,SequenceReq,RIN) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R90_Outputs" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[This routine contains all logic that drives physical outputs, with the exception of HMI_OutTog AOIs in the manual control routine.  All state status bits must be commented.
Outputs should be on either a single OTE or in latch/unlatch pairs on CONSECUTIVE RUNGS ONLY]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Flex feeder return conveyor]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(in_Safety.OK)[XIC(in_Mode.Manual) [XIC(HMI_RunReturnConv) ,XIC(RunReturnConv) ] ,XIC(RIN.ConvMoving) ,XIC(c_DG_Debug.3) ]OTE(OUT_RunReturnConv);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[OTE(ROUT.PickSinglePart);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(\S01_Load.q_PlaceUpstream) OTE(ROUT.DI45) ,XIC(\S01_Load.q_PickUpstream) OTE(ROUT.DI46) ,XIC(\S01_Load.q_PlaceDownstream) OTE(ROUT.DI47) ,XIC(\S01_Load.q_PickDownstream) OTE(ROUT.DI48) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(RIN.DO47) OTE(q_DownstreamPlaced) ,XIC(RIN.DO45) OTE(q_UpstreamPlaced) ,XIC(RIN.DO48) OTE(q_DownstreamPicked) ,XIC(RIN.DO46) OTE(q_UpstreamPicked) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(ResumeOK)EQ(ActiveRecipe.RobotEndEffector,RobotEndEffectorPre)OTE(q_AutoOk);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(in_Safety.OK)[XIC(in_Mode.Manual) XIC(HMI_TurnOnHopper) ,XIC(in_Mode.Running) XIO(\IndexerDial.Cleanout_Enabled) XIC(q_FlexFeedConvReadyOn) XIC(HMI_FeedersEnable) ]OTE(q_HopperOn);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(in_Safety.OK)[XIC(in_Mode.Manual) XIC(HMI_TurnOnBowl) ,XIC(in_Mode.Running) XIO(\IndexerDial.Cleanout_Enabled) XIC(q_FlexFeedConvReadyOn) XIC(HMI_FeedersEnable) ]OTE(q_BowlOn);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(in_Safety.OK)[XIC(in_Mode.Manual) XIC(HMI_TurnOnLinear) ,XIC(in_Mode.Running) XIO(\IndexerDial.Cleanout_Enabled) XIC(q_FlexFeedConvReadyOn) XIC(HMI_FeedersEnable) ]OTE(q_LinearOn);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\Recipe.DownloadPulse)MOVE(ActiveRecipe.FeederHopperSpeed,HMI_FeederHopperSpeed)MOVE(ActiveRecipe.FeederBowlSpeed,HMI_FeederBowlSpeed)MOVE(ActiveRecipe.FeederLinearTrackSpeed,HMI_FeederLinearTrackSpeed);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[ClampValue_DINT(AOI_ClampHopperSpeed,0,100,HMI_FeederHopperSpeed)ClampValue_DINT(AOI_ClampBowlSpeed,0,100,HMI_FeederBowlSpeed)ClampValue_DINT(AOI_ClampLinearSpeed,0,100,HMI_FeederLinearTrackSpeed)CPT(HopperSpeed_AO_OUT.ProcessDataOut.Analog_Output_Value,HMI_FeederHopperSpeed / 100.0 * (FEEDER_SATURATION_VOLTAGE - FEEDER_MINIMUM_VOLTAGE) + FEEDER_MINIMUM_VOLTAGE)CPT(BowlFeederSpeed_AO_OUT.ProcessDataOut.Analog_Output_Value,HMI_FeederBowlSpeed / 100.0 * (FEEDER_SATURATION_VOLTAGE - FEEDER_MINIMUM_VOLTAGE) + FEEDER_MINIMUM_VOLTAGE)CPT(InlineFeederSpeed_AO_OUT.ProcessDataOut.Analog_Output_Value,HMI_FeederLinearTrackSpeed / 100.0 * (FEEDER_SATURATION_VOLTAGE - FEEDER_MINIMUM_VOLTAGE) + FEEDER_MINIMUM_VOLTAGE);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="R95_RobotOutputs" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Output signals to robot]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Zero out empty PR]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[MOVE(0,EmptyPR.uframe) MOVE(0,EmptyPR.utool) MOVE(0,EmptyPR.turn1) MOVE(0,EmptyPR.turn2) MOVE(0,EmptyPR.turn3) ,OTU(EmptyPR.front) OTU(EmptyPR.up) OTU(EmptyPR.left) OTU(EmptyPR.flip) ,MOVE(0,EmptyPR.X) MOVE(0,EmptyPR.Y) MOVE(0,EmptyPR.Z) MOVE(0,EmptyPR.W) MOVE(0,EmptyPR.P) MOVE(0,EmptyPR.R) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Only dropped out for collaborative robots]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[OTE(ROUT.SafeSpeed);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[OTE(ROUT.Enable);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Only dropped out for collision avoidance or crash prevention]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[OTE(ROUT.ImmediateStop);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Only dropped out if it is necessary to pause robot program]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[OTE(ROUT.Hold);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\S01_Load.q_RobotPlacePartReq)XIC(\IndexerDial.q_IndexerInPosition)[XIO(\S01_Load.q_RobotWaitToPlace) OTE(ROUT.OKLoadPart) ,OTE(ROUT.DialOnStation) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(\IndexerDial.q_RobotOkToOpenNest)OTE(ROUT.DI20);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(in_Mode.Manual)OTU(HMI_StopAtDial);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_StopAtDial)OTE(ROUT.StopAtDial);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="10" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(HMI_ModelIDBias)OTE(ROUT.ModelIDBias);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="11" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(MB.AlwaysOff)XIC(ActiveRobotRecipe.PermaSeal)OTE(ROUT.PinPushNeeded);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="12" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Pass PLC mode status outputs]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(in_Mode.Auto)OTE(ROUT.PLCAuto);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="13" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(in_Mode.Running) ,XIC(c_DG_Debug.6) ]OTE(ROUT.PLCRunning);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="14" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[HandshakeAck is latched by other machine programs once they've processed signals from robot.
Robot will turn off those signals in BG logic when it receives ROUT.HandshakeAck]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(HandshakeAck) ,XIC(RIN.SafeHomeRunning) ]OTU(HandshakeAck)OTL(ROUT.HandshakeAck);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="15" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[If the machine is running, then turn off the purge bowl bit]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(in_Mode.Running)XIO(in_Mode.Stopping)XIC(HMI_b_Changeover)OTL(HMI_PurgeBowl);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="16" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(in_Mode.Auto)ONS(OneShot.12)OTU(HMI_PurgeBowl);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="17" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Purge Bowl requests]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(in_Mode.Running)XIO(in_Mode.Stopping)[XIC(HMI_PurgeBowl) [ONS(OneShot.8) OTL(ROUT.ReqConvOn) ,XIC(RIN.ConvMoving) ONS(OneShot.11) OTL(ROUT.ReqFeederOn) ,MUL(HMI_PurgeTimeoutMin,60000,TMR_PurgeOff.PRE) TON(TMR_PurgeOff,?,?) XIC(TMR_PurgeOff.DN) OTU(HMI_PurgeBowl) ] ,XIO(HMI_PurgeBowl) ONS(OneShot.9) OTU(ROUT.ReqConvOn) OTU(ROUT.ReqFeederOn) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="18" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(HMI_PurgeBowl)ONS(OneShot.10)OTU(ROUT.ReqConvOn)OTU(ROUT.ReqFeederOn);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="19" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[array of handshake signals from robot
If they're all off, robot BG logic has seen the handshake ack and turned them all off]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(RIN.PartLoadComplete)XIO(RIN.SafeHomeRunning)OTU(ROUT.HandshakeAck);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="20" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[PLC request ack from Robot]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(RIN.PLCReqAck)OTU(ROUT.ReqNestOpenerExt)OTU(ROUT.ReqNestOpenerRet)OTU(ROUT.ReqGripOpen)OTU(ROUT.ReqGripClose);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="21" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[HMI_OutMom(HMI_ResetMIDCounts,1,1000,0,0,1,0,SecurityLevel,0,0)XIC(HMI_ResetMIDCounts.Out)OTE(ROUT.ResetModelIDCounts);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="22" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Copy handshaking out (inputs to robot)
Required DIO/system/setup config:
IO\UOP in (all):  Rack 89, slot 1, start pt 1
Digital inputs:  1-64:  Rack 89, slot 1, start pt 25
Group inputs (Rack 89, slot 1, 8 bits each).  Start points:  1: 89, 2: 97, 3: 105, 4:113, 5: 121
In System\Config screen set the following:
Enable UI signals: TRUE
START for CONTINUE only:  TRUE
CSTOPI for ABORT:  TRUE
Abort all programs by CSTOPI:  TRUE
Other system\config items are set related to inputs, see inputs routine
]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
